scope: the list set in force for this account
This describes the list set in force, not any installed credential.
credential: not checked (this shows the policy, not any installed credential)
in force: generation 7
latest attempt: generation 8, refused
server nats-a: generation 7
server nats-b: generation 7
generation: 7

switches:
  c mail shared
  c prompt closed
  c status shared
  c heartbeat shared

senders:
  c.core
    allow: d.build
    deny: (none)
    reaches by mail: c.core, c.lead, d.build
    reaches by prompt: d.build
    reaches by status: c.core, c.lead, d.build
    reaches by heartbeat: c.core, c.lead, d.build
    open publish: $JS.ACK.inbox-agent_c_core.deliver.>, $JS.API.CONSUMER.INFO.inbox-agent_c_core.deliver, $JS.API.CONSUMER.MSG.NEXT.inbox-agent_c_core.deliver, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.KV_mash-directory.>, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.KV_mash-leases.$KV.mash-leases.agent_c_core, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.inbox-agent_c_core, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.inbox-agent_c_core.>, $JS.API.INFO, $JS.API.STREAM.INFO.KV_mash-directory, $JS.API.STREAM.INFO.KV_mash-leases, $JS.API.STREAM.INFO.inbox-agent_c_core, $KV.mash-leases.agent_c_core, $SRV.>, _INBOX.>, mash.policy
    open subscribe: $SRV.>, _INBOX.agent_c_core.>
  c.lead
    allow: (none)
    deny: c.core
    reaches by mail: c.lead
    reaches by prompt: (none)
    reaches by status: c.lead
    reaches by heartbeat: c.lead
    open publish: $JS.ACK.inbox-agent_c_lead.deliver.>, $JS.API.CONSUMER.INFO.inbox-agent_c_lead.deliver, $JS.API.CONSUMER.MSG.NEXT.inbox-agent_c_lead.deliver, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.KV_mash-directory.>, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.KV_mash-leases.$KV.mash-leases.agent_c_lead, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.inbox-agent_c_lead, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.inbox-agent_c_lead.>, $JS.API.INFO, $JS.API.STREAM.INFO.KV_mash-directory, $JS.API.STREAM.INFO.KV_mash-leases, $JS.API.STREAM.INFO.inbox-agent_c_lead, $KV.mash-leases.agent_c_lead, $SRV.>, _INBOX.>, mash.policy
    open subscribe: $SRV.>, _INBOX.agent_c_lead.>

The reply and plumbing subjects stay open whatever the lists say: a raw client can send data to another address on them. The lists govern who may mail, prompt, probe and watch whom, not who may communicate at all.
